></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">  PH ~risk +gender+age</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">#residual correlations</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">MH ~~ PH&#39;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">fit&lt;-sem(SUMMERMODEL, data=SUMMER_final, missing= &quot;FIML.X&quot;)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">summary(fit,standardized=TRUE)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"># moderation analysis</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">semdata&lt;-data.frame(predict(fit))</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">-centering (IV and moderator)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">riskc&lt;-scale(semdata$risk,center=TRUE,scale=FALSE)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">semdata$PSc&lt;-scale(SUMMER_final$PS,center = TRUE,scale = FALSE)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">xz&lt;-riskc*PSc</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">mod1&lt;-lm(MH~ riskc+PSc+xz+gender+age)</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">summary(mod1, fit.measures=TRUE)</span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Everything worked great. I was wondering if I could see the model fit (i.e. CFI, RMSEA)  when I include my moderator. When I ran mod1 (moderator analysis), I was only able to get </span></font>estimates and <i>SE</i>s etc. </p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><br></p><p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\">Does this make sense now ?</p></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Aug 26, 2020 at 1:21 AM Terrence Jorgensen &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Is there any way that I can get a model fit with a moderator variable in SEM (e.g., CFI, RMSEA etc). I am trying to do that after the structural  model; but I can&#39;t.</blockquote><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m not sure what you mean.  Are you saying that your ran a model (which converges, provides parameter estimates and <i>SE</i>s) that does not provide any output from<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> fitMeasures()</font>?  A reproducible example (minimal syntax and data) could help illustrate what you mean to ask.</div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420835789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jw2ICo6Ui1cLEtZ2n3TME\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div><br></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/24a3dda8-6f37-464d-83c6-727803effdb0o%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/24a3dda8-6f37-464d-83c6-727803effdb0o%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792420835789000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ropsOE6bRHzpjHIP6670u\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/24a3dda8-6f37-464d-83c6-727803effdb0o%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
